<Slide style={{width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei'}}><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8'}}></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>过程⑥：回写、交付前精修与交付</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C9DCF7', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>03 第二阶段 · 过程</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 88, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9}}><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F0F5FC', paddingLeft: 15, paddingRight: 15, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, justifyContent: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>默认不回写（纯 Baldwin），回写仅为可选对照通道；polish 把适应度看不见的成本余量收割掉。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 12}}><Box style={{width: 620, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 15, gap: 9}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>回写通道：默认纯 Baldwin（不回写）</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>适应度按修复解评价，基因型保持修复前；master 默认 repair_replacement = 0，修复效益只留在评价层。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>绝对不变式：基因长度恒为 N，绝不增删。只有置换（而非插入 / 删除）才能在「每任务恰一次」下安全落地。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>可选 Lamarck：repair_replacement 取 0 到 1 的连续比例；lamarckian=True 等价 1.0，属旧 config 兼容，exp01 / exp05 仍显式开启。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>M1 只回写起始任务归属通道，M2-1 额外回写段内序（默认关）；台账记 selection_object=S_repair 与 inherited_object=g_raw。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 524, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 15, gap: 9}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>交付后成本 polish（不重开种群）</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>三层邻域：polish_assignment 的 relocate / swap / 插入位；组内 2-opt 段反转与 Or-opt 段迁移；跨机单任务改派（受体含空闲机）。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>为什么放在搜索之外：修复链每一步都要重解终点巢子问题、成本昂贵；polish 只在交付前跑一次，且只压成本、不碰任务集合，覆盖与完成语义不受影响。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>可选搜索期内强化：每 memetic_K 代对当代精英跑紧预算 polish，维护 best-polished 档案（不改基因型）；交付解取「收敛后 polish」与「档案最优」的更优者，默认关。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, gap: 8}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>统一接受纪律：四道门 + 两个保守门</Text><Box style={{width: 1128, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 9}}><Box style={{width: 270, minHeight: 82, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>① 航程门 · 改后全航程 ≤ 剩余航程</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 270, minHeight: 82, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>② 迟到门 · 迟到数与总量逐分量不劣化</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 270, minHeight: 82, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>③ 执行集门 · 覆盖只增不减</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 270, minHeight: 82, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>④ 成本门 · 航程严格下降超过 ε</Text></Box></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>sequence_group 激活时另加时序门与链成员整体禁迁；全程无随机、逐位可复现，纯成本改进 ⇒ λ 为正时适应度严格改进。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>动态滚动的多机巢多无人机协同任务分配 · 方法讲解</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>17 / 19</Text></Box></Slide>